":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-02-16T09:47:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-17T18:25:39Z","closed_at":"2025-02-16T17:22:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102915","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102915.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102915.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds a new method for `Array`, which removes all the elements which satisfy the specified predicate.\r\n\r\n```gd\r\nvar array: Array[int] = [ 0, 1, 2, 3, 10 ]\r\nvar remove_count: int = array.erase_custom(func(v: int): return v % 2 == 0)\r\nprint(remove_count, \" \", array) # Prints 3 [1, 3]\r\n```\r\n\r\n<hr>\r\n\r\nCurrently I don't think there is a good way to remove elements from an Array in a loop. You can either remove by iterating from the end ...\r\n```gd\r\nvar array: Array[int] = [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\r\nfor i in range(array.size()-1, -1, -1):\r\n\tarray.remove_at(i)\r\n```\r\n... or just design around the idea, that you'll not be able to do so.","closed_by":{"login":"A-Machynak","id":99248176,"node_id":"U_kgDOBepoMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99248176?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak","html_url":"https://github.com/A-Machynak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/A-Machynak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102915/reactions","total_count":9,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102915/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}